  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize the Jack and Nine of trumps. Without at least one of these two cards, your team is extremely vulnerable to being 'Cracked'.\n\nThe 'Compulsory Lead': Since the first player must pick trumps, they should pick their strongest suit even if it's mediocre. If they hold zero trumps, they must pick a suit where they have high Aces to defend against a Kraken.\n\nRoem Detection: Watch your partner's first lead. If they lead a card that looks unusual (like a 7 or 8), they might be signaling a void or a high sequence ('Roem') in their hand.",
    Player: "Prioritize the Jack and Nine of trumps. Without at least one of these two cards, your team is extremely vulnerable to being 'Cracked'.\n\nThe 'Compulsory Lead': Since the first player must pick trumps, they should pick their strongest suit even if it's mediocre. If they hold zero trumps, they must pick a suit where they have high Aces to defend against a Kraken.\n\nRoem Detection: Watch your partner's first lead. If they lead a card that looks unusual (like a 7 or 8), they might be signaling a void or a high sequence ('Roem') in their hand.",
