      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Only 'Crack' if you hold at least the Trump Jack or the Trump Nine. If you have neither, the makers will likely fulfill their contract.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Capturing the last trick is worth 10 points. In a 'Cracked' game, this becomes 20, 40, or 80 points!",
